WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.936
-Thanks to newly developed
technology here at "Late Night,"

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:05.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
we now have the ability to
record the tiny voice

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:06.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
that is inside
Donald Trump's head.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you might
be surprised to know that,

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:10.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
like everyone's inner voice,
Donald Trump's

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:13.680
is filled with
paralyzing fear and self-doubt.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.547 line:92%
So, here it is once again,

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:17.884
the tiny voice in
the back of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:20.320 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:23.623 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey, Donald.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:25.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the tiny voice
in the back of your head,

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:27.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's time to
sign some documents

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.596 line:92%
with your very large signature.

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:32.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, first, peek at
the other guys's papers,

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.366 line:92%
like you did in middle school.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.200 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay, good peeking.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:40.106
And now remember to do it
real big and real slow

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.208 line:92%
to make everybody else wait.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's what you call
a power move.

00:00:44.077 --> 00:00:45.445 line:92%
Okay. And now trade them.

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:47.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
Take one. Take another one.
Now you have two.

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:50.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
Justin has zero. Oh!
Whoa! Oh!

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:51.651 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I liked when I had two.

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:53.520 line:92%
Okay. Now look at it again.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
This looks like something
you've seen before.

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:56.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, it's a copy of
what you just did.

00:00:56.756 --> 00:01:04.998 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay. Real big and real slow,
like a winner.

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:07.300 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

